<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Live basis - compared with Tuesday's close, steers and heifers were not well established, with a higher undertone noted, USDA said.</p>
<p>Steers:  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1300 lbs 68.50</p>
<p>Carcass basis:</p>
<p>A higher undertone noted on steers and heifers.</p>
<p>Steers:   Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250-1300 lbs 111.00</p>
<p>Heifers;  Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150-1200 lbs 111.00 Reported sales for Wed: 700   Week to Date: 4,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
